#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:1
msgid "RBM Classification: Handwritten Digit Recognition"
msgstr "RBM 分类：手写数字识别"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial builds on the [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) and [Section "
"4.2: Restricted Boltzmann Machine](../../theoretical-foundations/kpp-"
"theoretical-foundations-bm-restricted.md). It walks through a complete "
"two-stage pipeline: train an RBM on handwritten digits, use its hidden "
"activations as features, and attach a logistic regression classifier on "
"top. Using the same positive/negative phase loop as the [Quick "
"Start](../quickstart.md), this tutorial focuses on the feature-extraction"
" pipeline and downstream classification."
msgstr ""
"本教程基于 [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) 和 [4.2 节：受限玻尔兹曼机"
"](../../theoretical-foundations/kpp-theoretical-foundations-bm-"
"restricted.md)，演示完整的两阶段流水线：在手写数字上训练 RBM，将其隐层激活作为特征，并在其上接逻辑回归分类器。使用与 "
"[Quick Start](../quickstart.md) 相同的正相/负相循环，本教程重点关注特征提取流水线和下游分类。"

