#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:35
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "原理概览"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:37
msgid ""
"The RBM training loop is identical to the [Quick "
"Start](../quickstart.md): positive phase from data, negative phase from "
"`rbm.sample(sampler)`, and `rbm.objective(...)` provides the surrogate "
"loss. The theoretical details of RBM energy functions and conditional "
"independence are covered in [Section 4.2](../../theoretical-foundations"
"/kpp-theoretical-foundations-bm-restricted.md); here we focus on why RBMs"
" work as unsupervised feature extractors."
msgstr ""
"RBM 训练循环与 [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) 完全相同：正相来自数据，负相来自 "
"`rbm.sample(sampler)`，`rbm.objective(...)` 提供代理损失。RBM 能量函数和条件独立性的理论细节见 "
"[4.2 节](../../theoretical-foundations/kpp-theoretical-foundations-bm-"
"restricted.md)；此处我们重点关注为什么 RBM 可以作为无监督特征提取器。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:39
msgid ""
"RBMs are bipartite energy-based models: visible and hidden layers are "
"connected across, but not within, each layer. Lower-energy configurations"
" have higher probability, and the hidden units learn to combine raw "
"pixels into more abstract features — exactly what makes RBMs useful as a "
"feature extraction stage before a downstream classifier."
msgstr ""
"RBM 是二部能量模型：可见层与隐层跨层连接，但层内无连接。低能量配置具有更高概率，隐层学习将原始像素组合为更抽象的特征——这正是 RBM "
"作为下游分类器前特征提取阶段的价值所在。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:41
msgid "The overall pipeline is:"
msgstr "整体流水线如下："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/rbm_classification.md:47
msgid ""
"The dataset uses scikit-learn's 8×8 handwritten digits, augmented by "
"shifting each image up, down, left, and right to expand the training set."
" The notebook compares the two-stage RBM pipeline against a logistic "
"regression on raw pixels to demonstrate that unsupervised RBM pretraining"
" improves classification accuracy."
msgstr ""
"数据集使用 scikit-learn 的 8×8 手写数字，通过将每个图像向上下左右四个方向平移来扩展训练集。notebook 对比两阶段 RBM"
" 流水线与原始像素上的逻辑回归，证明无监督 RBM 预训练能提升分类准确率。"

